            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ye bwidha, abaana baimwe baidhanga kubabuuza imwe bati, ‘Amateeka n'ebiragiro n'okulamba, Musengwa Katonda waife bye yatuteeragho bitegeeza ki?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo munaabairangamu muti, ‘Twali bairu ba kyabazinga w'e Misiri, aye Musengwa Katonda yaatutoolayo ng'akozesa amaani ge agataloodheka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tweboneraku beene n'amaiso gaife ebyewuunhio n'ebyewuninkiriza eby'amaani era ebitiisa, Musengwa Katonda oyo bye yakola ku Misiri, ni ku kyabazinga waayo, ni ku bakungu ba kyabazinga oyo boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ife yaatutoolayo yaatuleeta ghano, yaatugha ensi eno ye yasuubiza badhaadha baife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda waife oyo yaatulagira okutuukirizanga amateeka ago goonagoona n'okumutyanga, olwo tughange okubanga obukalamu buliidho, era atukuumenga nga tuli balamu, nga bwe tuli mpegaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ife kye tugwaine okukola, n'okwegendereza tutuukirizenga byonabyona Musengwa Katonda waife bye yatulagira.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
